{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 164262, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 110581, "uid": 87565, "type": 4, "title": "天子选择引导", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1659852577, "updated_at": 1682128015, "updated_uid": 87565, "comment_at": 1684901228, "last_at": 1688731014, "comment_count": 14, "status": 1, "summary": "前言变强就是：选天子，强化天子、挣资源、花资源、（氪金）（超链接文章名点击可直接打开）生活中常有人说选择要比努力更重要，在DC这个游戏里也一样适用，选对了天子自然会事半功倍。虽然我们可能是因为某些角色", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 49, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 213205, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 93, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 164262, "content": "<div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:24px;font-weight:700;\">前言</span></div></div><br><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">变强就是：</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">选天子</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">，</span><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/157898.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\">强化天子</a><span style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;、<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/161028.html\" target=\"_blank\">挣资源</a>、<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/164568.html\" target=\"_blank\">花资源</a>、（<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/152152.html\" target=\"_blank\">氪金</a>）</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);font-size:16px;text-align:center;\">（超链接文章名点击可直接打开）</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);font-size:16px;text-align:center;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;生活中常有人说选择要比努力更重要，在DC这个游戏里也一样适用，选对了天子自然会事半功倍。虽然我们可能是因为某些角色很色才加入游戏，但我们也仍然需要变强才能获得更多心仪的天子。其中对花瓶（XP）的培养自然要量力而行。</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">简短知识：</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1、加值就是天子的+号后面的数字最大+6需要使用相同天子，加值上线等于当前星级。</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2、进化就是使用当前同等稀有度（星级）天子，给一名满级天子提升星级最多6星。</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3、点火就是使用点火系统强化天子共12级，中间一行点火会使天子的星级逐渐变红。</span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">（本帖针对新人半新人服务，“萌新”和大佬自己有定夺并时不时弄出骚套路）</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">前置知识点，及<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">思路</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></span></span></div></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">本帖所指</span></span><br></span></div><div><span style=\"\">1、大佬：主流角色已经+6满火“<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">U</span>”，有多于资源用来培养非主流天子。能有力竞争各种排行榜。</span></div><div><span style=\"\">2、成长期：强力通用天子已经拥有<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">或</span>，PVP16,000+，乱斗小有成就，RD4名通用辅扰带个RD刀就能斩车、地狱勉强能通、RB刮痧能30，WB50E。</span></div></span></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><span style=\"\">3、新人：主线打完了<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">或</span>，RD斩不过，RB1刮不死，PVP5000以下，乱斗连队伍都没有，进入地狱星云被当场撂倒。</span></div></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><span style=\"\"></span></div><div></div></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line3\"></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;我们的目地是，用最少的资源培养最少的天子办最多的事，以便于前期过度更早的获取更多资源。</span></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">文字较多的选用思路</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">那么应该选用原则应该是：用途广泛（比较强力）&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">所参与活动频率及回报率（奖励）高&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">强力</span><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">那么天子的常见用法分类：</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">PVP：每日350钻、10W金币（每周2450钻+70W金币）、每周5300钻+38点火石（<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">1900钻</span>）=7200</span><span style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">（参与力度每日<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">40场左右</span>）</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">PVE：星云小关必备，越早通关就可以越早开始攒票，地狱新装备材料或300W+金币</span></div><div style=\"\"></div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">（参与力度每周或每日及前置）</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">乱斗：一般人，一项1300到500左右 一周2000~3000钻，三项10%才将近4000钻和90个附魔材料，每天打有点蚊子腿，（奖励相比PVP真的少）</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">（每周至少6波30次）（每年1560场乱斗）</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">RD：天子主要获取活动、需要积极参加，其中RB奖励大量点火石。</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">（参与力度每年10次）（所以属性专用天子平均1年<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">用</span>2次）（RB现在新人好好运营也能刮过）</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">WB：所有活动中奖励最惨淡的，且20人本，还好大部分RD天子也能来这边帮忙，且有不少通用角色，有共同世界奖励，世界奖励全靠大佬但也不能大家全都摆烂躺平是吧，大家加油。</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">（参与力度每年6次）（所以属性专属天子平均1年用1次，有用的天子里面最没用的）</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">（但成为真丶大佬不花钻就拿完商店奖励那确实不错相当于白嫖）</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">一、实际对策</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、因为当前环境原因异常队伍的顶流PVP天子通用性太强，这个队伍的80%天子还能打地狱、星云，所以培养价值极高，需要想办法自选，有了的话可以优先还魂。</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、RD天子、如果不打RB休闲玩法拿只需要4名RD属性通用天子牵条RD刀就能斩车，这四名其中三名还能地狱星云。（RD刀是必备的可以还魂或者子选箱）</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、和第一条一样PVP天子U了能地狱星云，一般也能乱斗。</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、WB属性专用天子，狗粮实在天子不够了，可以考虑用他们，尤其是很早以前出的下岗危机的。</span></div></span></div>\n                               </div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">天子选择方法指引</span></div></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">1、天子图鉴</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></div></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;由于百科更新，新增筛选功能,全5星天子以增加筛选功能，应用分类带有粗略评价</span></div><div><div style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img data-width=\"788\" data-height=\"177\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_788/h_177/1069/87565/2022/7/7/78141.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_788/h_177/1069/87565/2022/7/7/78141.png\"></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"796\" data-height=\"187\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_796/h_187/1069/87565/2022/7/7/782426.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_796/h_187/1069/87565/2022/7/7/782426.png\"></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2、全天子评价表-节奏榜</span></div></div><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\">1、入门宝典《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/154546.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 20px; color: rgba(0, 182, 79, 0.7);\">天子全攻略</a><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: rgba(0, 182, 79, 0.7);\"><span>文</span><span>字版</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span>》By“<div data-v-d61bcda2=\"\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; display: inline !important;\"><span data-v-d61bcda2=\"\" style=\"margin:0px0px0px0.21333rem;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><a data-v-d61bcda2=\"\" href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/user/index?uid=97037\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"user-wrapper-title\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">我只是小鸡炖蘑菇</span></a>”</span></span></div></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">（杰瑞不怎么更，目前属于代管状态）</span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line3\"></div><br></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">XYZ新帖：</span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">《</span><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-size: 19.9999px; font-weight: 700;\"><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/168545.html\" target=\"_blank\">培养价值及相性</a></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">》</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">综合性非常强看这个就够了</span> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;\">(只能XYZ更别人帮不了，注意时效)</span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">XYZ旧贴：注意结合更新时间，看是否符合当前环境</span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">2、进阶理解《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/153517.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">天子定位图</a>》<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">By<span style=\"color:rgb(21,21,21);font-size:19.9999px;text-align:right;\">“xyzpace”：<span style=\"color:rgb(21,21,21);font-size:19.9999px;font-weight:700;\">现阶段常用天子推荐</span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(21,21,21);font-size:19.9999px;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-size: 19.9999px;\">3、<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 20px;\">进阶理解《<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/153435.html\" target=\"_blank\">五色BUFF角图鉴</a></span>》<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">By</span><span style=\"color:rgb(21,21,21);font-size:19.9999px;text-align:right;\">“xyzpace”：<span style=\"color:rgb(21,21,21);font-size:19.9999px;font-weight:700;\">常见PvE增益技能</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line3\"></div><br></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">下面这两个用处不大了属于考古类型</span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">4、</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">旧资料《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/71454.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">天子节奏榜</a>》停更一年左右 By “<span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">fd3svi”：</span><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-weight: 700;\">全天子评价一图流</span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21);\">5、<span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">旧资料《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/55398.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">天子筛查表</a>》被新筛选代替 By “K站一姐/兔兔酱“：</span><span style=\"color:rgb(21,21,21);font-size:19.9999px;font-weight:700;\">天子全图鉴列表</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(21,21,21);font-size:19.9999px;font-weight:700;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div></span><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(21,21,21);font-size:19.9999px;font-weight:700;\"></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(21,21,21);font-size:19.9999px;font-weight:700;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">3、活动专用类型天子选择</span></div></div><br></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-size: 19.9999px;\">1、世界地图、日常活动图、星云小关1/2、翻牌本等低难度无威胁关卡。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: right; \"><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-size: 19.9999px;\">——《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/153635.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">最速日常队</a>》By“xyzpace”、“纠结37”（扩展）</span></div><div style=\"text-align: right; \"><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-size: 19.9999px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">2、RB活动天子阵容《<span style=\"color:rgb(21,21,21);font-size:19.9999px;font-weight:700;\"><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/95082.html\" target=\"_blank\">Raid大型攻略</a></span>》DC最重要获得天子活动，<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">优先度最高！</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">——By“海洋饼干”</span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">3、WB活动天子阵容《<span style=\"color:rgb(21,21,21);font-size:19.9999px;font-weight:700;\"><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/89833.html\" target=\"_blank\">WB攻略分享</a></span>》新手优先度较低活动真大佬才能玩出成绩</span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">——By“划”</span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">4、PVP天梯、乱斗天梯</span></div></div><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">1、日常PVP-5v5，每周奖励钻石，和可兑换点火石的奖杯、及荣登”萌新”大佬榜</span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">——《<span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-size: 19.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/163844.html\" target=\"_blank\">BG-天梯前百攻略</a>》By</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; text-align: right;\">“</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; text-align: right;\">海洋饼干<span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; text-align: right;\">”</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">2、天梯上用啥你用啥，点开排行榜前一百名的配置都能看见，5v5还能看见装备。缺点是这些天子的通用性可能不高。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">五、当前优质通用角推荐（23年4月这些天子仍然不错）</span></div></div><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container active-item\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">参考建议</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><img data-v-34546da4=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605161832423_16500496.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605161832423_16500496.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"height:70px;width:70px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">入游就送<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\">,偶尔</span>仍然能出现在活动的天梯排行榜上，通用性爆表&nbsp; 前期什么图都能上去用，后期也不会彻底下岗。（当你成为真正的大佬那她就会隐退了）我觉得那天策划怀旧还能给加强</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">咯。（预测成功了，嫦娥22年年末加强重做）</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><img data-v-34546da4=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605161798555_9377339.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605161798555_9377339.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">重做后又行了，那都能上RD和WB<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">通用</span>，地狱、星云就是PVP差点，乱斗双重乱斗能用。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><img data-v-34546da4=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605158773314_52661384.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605158773314_52661384.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size:13.9999px;width:70px;height:70px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">控制超模，PVP16000+能用，乱斗阵容没齐能上，双重乱斗也行，星云地狱很强。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><img data-v-34546da4=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/59348/2022/2/25/690071.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/59348/2022/2/25/690071.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">控制之神，除了巨型BOSS，其他环境都能用而且基本T1。</span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><img data-v-34546da4=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1640535951764_62666106.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1640535951764_62666106.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">辅助之神，无敌，万能。没有她上不了场的情况，上了大部分情况也是T1级别。</div><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><img data-v-34546da4=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1609491221281_85228034.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1609491221281_85228034.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">老天子逐渐隐退，除去<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">巨型BOSS</span>算是都能用，比她强的没有远射，有远射的没她通用性强。</div><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><img data-v-34546da4=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605157956009_48209886.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605157956009_48209886.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">总是减员被打死快用复活奶，用到你成为大佬还能用！？注意怕对面毒奶（星云、地铁）</div><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1610754872485_36206594.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 70px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">+闪避，+敏捷，-冷却，+转速 和甜甜圈一样除了巨型都能上 PVP 乱斗 更强&nbsp; 地狱 星云 稍弱于甜甜圈<br></div></span></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">六、天子培养性价比<span style=\"color:rgb(0,182,79);font-size:24px;font-weight:700;text-align:left;\">（22年9月更）</span></span></div></div><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">个人理解 可以参考 XYZ新帖有详细全面评级</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">T0：全能</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">（尽快弄满格里拉、牡丹有就马上练起来）</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;格里拉【辅】：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\">白图、皮肤塔、星云、地狱、RD全属性选用、RB全属性选用、WB全属性或木、PVPT1、乱斗替补、全能的神<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\">）（全能用且大部分一线水平）</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;牡丹【辅】：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\">白图、星云、地狱、RD全属性选用、RB全属性选用、WB全属性T2、乱斗替补、（全能用半数情况一线）</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;\"></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;\">T1：</span>（排序前后优先级略有差异但不大）</span></div><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">1、通用天子代表</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align:left;\"></div><span style=\"\"><div style=\"text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;薇薇安【扰】：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\">白图、星云、地狱、<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\">PVP、乱斗（Vva）</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;甜甜圈【扰】：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\">白图、星云、地狱、<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\">PVP、乱斗（<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">里</span>莫斯）</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;老板娘<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">【扰</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">】</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">：</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">白图、<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">星云、<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">地狱、</span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">PVP、乱斗、WB通用、（兰佩伊）</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;马尔斯【刀】：皮肤塔、<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\">白图、星云选用、地狱选用、PVP中低分段、乱斗、（新偶像队）</span></div><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;复活奶【奶】：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">白图、星云、地狱、WB新手通用、RD/RB新手通用（玛特）</span></span></div></span><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\"></span></div></span></span><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\"></span></div><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">2、RD、RB通用天子（5人巨型BOSS）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;萨拉苏T0、牡丹T1、嫦娥T1、格里拉T1、复活奶T3（保命）、牵条狗【刀】都能混RD。<span style=\"text-decoration-line:line-through;\">极限练度应该可以五色斩车。</span></div><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"text-align:left;\"></div><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">3、RD、RB【<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\">刀</span>】</span></span></span>虽然通用性不高，但是打RB要高练度高伤害，追求RD快速斩通关RB要搞+值</div></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">当期是<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">（2022年9月）：</span></span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 光T1<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left;\">毕生的</span>奥拉夫（<span style=\"text-decoration-line:line-through;\">RD皮好看没皮肤不如光彩的莫娜</span>）</span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 光T2光彩的莫娜（<span style=\"text-decoration-line:line-through;\">活动皮好看没皮肤不如普通皮奥拉夫</span>）</span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 暗T1棒球，<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">T2马尔斯（旧）</span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 火T1狐狸，<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">T2魔龙</span>（<span style=\"text-decoration-line:line-through;\">两人虽然都是背对但我认为魔龙的臀更胜一筹</span>）</span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;木T1欧罗巴、尤娜，<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">T2安妮</span>（新尤娜原皮和RD皮都很香安妮应用度真的不搞了）</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 水T1比卢法，初音刀，百分比伤害刀（BUFF确实很强）</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; T2罗刹尼尔提（<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">永远的神，出什 么RD皮换什么刀你是嫌我不够美还是不够色，看到我的</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">姬友罗汉了么她不下岗我能下岗么</span>）</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\"></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: left; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">练新刀就行了T2都是怀旧伤害比不过，但既然都玩DC了那么颜值即正义，也不是不可以任性。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: left; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">罗刹出了氪金皮肤，而且竞速速刷RD仍然强。</span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line:line-through;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\"><br></span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"\">T2：</span></span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">1、PVP、乱斗天子：不多举例了</span></span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;PVP天子是你每天都要用的，乱斗也差不多，他们排在这里的原因首先是不练的话每天被虐游戏体验也不好，再一个是这些天子现在大部分也能用来打星云和地狱，代表天子有：新偶像队-金星</span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">2、RD属性专用：</span></span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;RD属性专用帮你更快斩车、打RB、星云小关BOSS、WB很多也能上、人数也不少培养起来就没那么简单了。</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">T3：WB属性通用：</span></span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;一年能用个6、7次，主要是破防角色，加速角色。代表性有：咪咪、哪吒、叶子、萨拉苏、提箱、木基佬、水罗汉、光弩</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;WB【刀】：</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 一般每种属性有3把，也可能有4把，有的天子有淘汰风险，有的还是联动天子得不到。</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"\">T4：WB属性专用</span></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;一年能用个1到2次虽然专用天子提升很大但上场机会是真的少，有用天子里面最没用的，一般来说都会留着+值，狗粮天子没了那他们就危险了尤其是有淘汰风险的老天子（或者牺牲XP天子他们就保住了，<span style=\"text-decoration-line:line-through;\">不要忘了初心啊喂</span>）。</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;WB还是所有活动投资回报最低的，星云大关还能赞票也不着急打。</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div></span></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div></span></span></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div></div></div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 87565, "username": "纠结37", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/11.png", "description": "DC混了一年半，好好玩半年，又要开始混了。", "follow_num": 141, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "不忘初心", "tag_color": "#FEC700"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 5, "content_at": 87603334, "content_num": 27, "read_num": 1273844, "like_num": 691}, "update_user": {"uid": 87565, "username": "纠结37", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/11.png", "description": "DC混了一年半，好好玩半年，又要开始混了。", "follow_num": 141, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 5, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1069, "name": "天命之子韩服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603255687217_81752678.webp?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "destinychild", "content_count": 6962, "follow_count": 16729}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 87565, "username": "纠结37", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/11.png", "last_ip_area": "吉林省", "last_login_device_num": 1}], "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2